{"product_id":"one-indian-girl","title":"One Indian Girl","description":"\u003cp\u003eHi, I'm Radhika Mehta and I'm getting married this week. I work at Goldman Sachs, an investment bank. Thank you for reading my story. However, let me warn you. You may not like me too much. One, I make a lot of money. Two, I have an opinion on everything. Three, I have had a boyfriend before. Ok, maybe two. Bestselling author Chetan Bhagat, writing for the first time in a female voice, brings to you One Indian Girl, the heart-warming story of a modern Indian girl. Now if all this was the case with a guy, one might be cool with it. But since I am a girl these three things I mentioned don't really make me too likeable, do they?--Page 4 of cover.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Chetan Bhagat\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9788129142146\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 272\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 16 x 200\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41757937303705,"sku":"13RC9788129142146","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/921c35a39440077b7b772498bf1fcf1b.jpg?v=1643208563","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/one-indian-girl","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}